    "text": "A particle is moving in xy-plane with a constant speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> such that its y displacement is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mtext>e</mtext><mrow><mtext>-</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>v</mtext><mtext>x</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mtext>v</mtext><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mtext>,</mtext></math>&nbsp;where v<sub>x</sub> is component of velocity along the x-axis. If at some instant x component of it velocity is positive and the slope of the tangent on its path is <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mtext>,</mtext></math>&nbsp;then the displacement of the particle in y-direction at the instant is",
